{"name":"Rich and Rare","hex":"#977540","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"rich","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Wealthy: having a lot of money and possessions.","Having an intense fatty or sugary flavour."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The rich people of a society or the world collectively, the rich class of a society.","(Can we verify this sense?)  the second placer in Tycoon"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/rich"},{"term":"and","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Symbol","definitions":["ISO 639-3 language code for Ansus."]},{"part":"Conjunction","definitions":["As a coordinating conjunction; expressing two elements to be taken together or in addition to each other.\nUsed simply to connect two noun phrases, adjectives or adverbs. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}\n\nSimply connecting two clauses or sentences. \n\nIntroducing a clause or sentence which follows on in time or consequence from the first.","Used simply to connect two noun phrases, adjectives or adverbs. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/and"},{"term":"rare","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Very uncommon; scarce.","Small in number (but not unusual); infrequent; sparse."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A scarce or uncommon item."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/rare"}],"entries":[{"title":"Rare (company)","blocks":[{"text":"Rare Limited is a British video game developer and a studio of Activision based in Twycross. Rare's games span the platform, first-person shooter, action-adventure, fighting, and racing genres. Its most popular games include the Battletoads, Donkey Kong, and Banjo-Kazooie series, as well as games like GoldenEye 007 (1997), Perfect Dark (2000), Conker's Bad Fur Day (2001), Viva Piñata (2006), and Sea of Thieves (2018)."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/d/d9/Rare_logo_2015.svg/330px-Rare_logo_2015.svg.p